<span id="id1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_middle" style="width:39.8pt;"><img src="2510.05571v1/fig/logo_new.png" id="g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_img_square" style="aspect-ratio:39/41;" width="39" height="41" alt="[Uncaptioned image]">
</span>
<span id="id2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Presenting a Paper is an Art</span>: Self-Improvement Aesthetic Agents for Academic Presentations</h1>
<div class="ltx_authors">
